00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:11.970
The concept is that the
applications we build

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:14.740
are similar enough that
they can be broken down

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:17.520
into reusable parts and snapped together

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.850
into new formations to
build new applications.

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:23.990
It's wonderful for
prototyping, and frankly,

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:27.270
