01:17:50.040 --> 01:17:52.620
There's a growing movement
called, serverless,

01:17:52.620 --> 01:17:55.210
and it tackles this problem exactly.

01:17:55.210 --> 01:17:57.430
You don't need to worry about the server,

01:17:57.430 --> 01:17:59.070
